# CPU app runtime (D1): batch supervisor, document owner, analysis runs,
# keywords and reporting. No Torch, VietOCR, ONNX Runtime or Docling.
# Must satisfy the `app` extra in pyproject.toml (tests/unit/runtime/test_packaging.py).
# Locks: requirements/v63/{windows,linux}-cpu-app.lock, regenerated only when this file
